  "review": {
    "timer": "Installed getitimer(2) states process virtual+system CPU accounting, interval rounding and interrupted syscalls. Requested interval is not measured cadence.",
    "signal": "Installed sigaction(2) documents SA_SIGINFO ucontext argument. Checked public arm64 PC accessor and context layout.",
    "handler": "Only lock-free atomic counter/PC stores plus ucontext reads; atomic_is_lock_free checked at startup. nm imports contain no out-of-line atomic support. This does not prove absence of sampling bias.",
    "scope": "Timer armed before operation clock and disabled after operation clock; small boundary helpers may be sampled. Fixture construction and warmup excluded.",
    "thread_timer": "PROFILE-002 dumps before thread clock ends; never interpret its thread/wall ratio. DIAG-006 moves dump after endpoint.",
